[19.9162, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[27;1H  Use English. Do not use tools or read any files or memories. Reply exactly: Ready  \r\n  to discuss three independent design topics.\u001b[40X\u001b[29;85H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mReady to discuss three independent design topics.\u001b[34X\u001b[32;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n  Worked for 5s • 14:01                                                              \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[34;85H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\r\n› \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: Runtime flow.\u001b[23X\r\n  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions. \r\n  Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks \r\n  you to implement changes.\u001b[58X\u001b[40;85H\u001b[1K\r\n  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[53X\r\n  In English, suggest two ways to simplify runtime lifecycle states. Start your      \r\n  answer with Runtime:. Max 30 words. Do not use tools.\u001b[30X\u001b[44;85H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r\n◦\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2mStarting MCP servers (4/5): codex_apps\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m(2s • \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1mesc\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m to interrupt)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[21X\u001b[47;85H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[1m\r\n"]
