[26.9634, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2m\u001b[2;87H  Worked for 5s • 14:01                                                               \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4;87H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\n› \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: CLI surface.\u001b[K\u001b[6;87H  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions.  \u001b[7;87H  Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks  \u001b[8;87H  you to implement changes.\u001b[K\u001b[9;87H\u001b[K\n  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[K\u001b[11;87H  In English, suggest two ways to simplify overlapping CLI commands. Start your       \u001b[12;87H  answer with CLI:. Max 30 words. Do not use tools.\u001b[K\u001b[13;87H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mCLI: Merge commands that perform the same action, using options for variations.     \u001b[16;87H  Standardize resource and action names, then deprecate redundant aliases with clear  \u001b[17;87H  migration guidance.\u001b[K\u001b[18;87H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n  Worked for 15s • 14:10                                                              \u001b[9;3H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
